  "selection_method": "Stratified expansion of the immutable 20-artifact v3 pilot to 64 named artifacts. The 20 v3 entries are retained byte for byte so outcome deltas are attributable to the evaluator alone. The 44 additions are judgmental coverage of gaps the v3 report names: universal wheels from setuptools, hatchling, flit-core, poetry-core, pdm-backend, and their own bootstrap artifacts; generated-layout and .data-bearing artifacts (ansible-core, jupyterlab, notebook, pybind11, cmake, ninja, uv, ruff); and native extensions across manylinux x86_64 and aarch64, musllinux x86_64, macOS x86_64 and arm64, and Windows x86_64 from setuptools, maturin, meson-python, and scikit-build-core, including cp312-abi3 and cp310-abi3 stable-ABI artifacts. For each addition, use the current non-yanked release returned by the PyPI JSON API on the query date and the lexicographically first file matching the recorded per-project tag rule. This is judgmental coverage, not a representative sample.",
